  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Đồ thị hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> là một parabol có\n\t\t\t<div class=\"with-figure\"><div><ul><li>Đỉnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>;</li><li>Trục đối xứng là đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>;</li><li>Bề lõm quay lên trên vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>;</li><li>Cắt trục tung tại điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>;</li><li>Phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> có hai nghiệm phân biệt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><